    "insert": "\nA good scientific writing style facilitates the reader's understanding significantly. In some sentences, your citation style (as highlighted in the text) and sudden jumps from one topic to the other hinders that a bit. While no major weakness, you should still try to unify the citations and focus especially on the transitions when editing your expose"
